"""
@title IDutchAuctionBurner
@author Curve Finance
@license MIT
@notice Full external ABI of DutchAuctionBurner: the Yearn-compatible
        IDutchAuction subset plus the auction core, adapter router, watchtower
        registration, roles, and FeeCollector integration surfaces.
@dev The burner `implements` this file, so every declaration is checked
     against the real surface at compile time; peer contracts (watchtower
     handler, intent resolver) and tooling read the burner through it; the
     lot record comes from auction_types, so nothing is mirrored.
"""

